<title>USA: CNS Bancorp to buy back up to 5 pct shrs.</title>
<headline>CNS Bancorp to buy back up to 5 pct shrs.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, Mo 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNS Bancorp Inc said Tuesday it will begin a stock buyback to acquire up to five percent, or about 82,656 shares, of its outstanding common.</p>
<p>The company expects to begin the buyback April 9 and complete it within three-and-a-half months. The company said no shares will be repurchased from its directors or officers.</p>
<p>CNS Bancorp is a unitary savings and loan holding company whose sole subsidiary is City National Savings Bank FSB.</p>
</text>
